---
import { images, imagePath } from '../../data/images';
interface Props { standalone?: boolean }
const { standalone = false } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="about-side-layout">
    <img class="about-side-image" src={imagePath('flow')} alt={images.flow.alt} loading={standalone ? 'eager' : 'lazy'} decoding="async" />
    <div class="about-block info-block">
      {standalone ? <h1>about</h1> : <h2><a class="section-link section-link--cream" href="/about">about</a></h2>}
      <p>The Castro Room is in the business of two things: teachers and atmosphere. We're devoted to supporting experts who practice what they teach, and to the stewardship of an outstanding physical space.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:1rem;">history</h2>
      <p>For decades, there's been a yoga studio at the corner of 18th and Collingwood. It's been through different eras and owners and names, but the studio has always been a beacon, locally and globally. The room has seen thousands of classes, tens of thousands of people, hundreds of thousands of discoveries. We nod to the legendary history of a container that's held so much, and open the door for everything that comes next.</p>

      <div class="info-list">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">info</h2>
        <p>The front door is locked ten minutes after the start of all classes and events.</p>
        <p>Class styles and temperatures vary by teacher.</p>
        <p>Mats and towels are available for rental.</p>
        <p>The studio is accessible by public transit.</p>
        <p>Street parking is available in the surrounding neighborhood.</p>
        <p>Please arrive early and stay for the entirety of class.</p>
        <p>Shoes should not be worn in the practice space.</p>
        <p>Silence devices, all the way.</p>
        <p>Please avoid strong scents.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
